cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "WRF C-Z0HR PBL Regularization (Experimental)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: England
    given-names: David E.
    email: David.England@UAH.Edu
identifiers:
  - description: "MYNN-EDMF submodule commit this release targets"
    type: other
    value: "NCAR/MYNN-EDMF@90f36c25259ec1960b24325f5b29ac7c5adeac73"
abstract: >-
  Curvature-Aware Zero-Offset Hyperbolic Regularization (C-Z0HR) of the
  gradient Richardson number profile for the MYNN-EDMF planetary boundary
  layer scheme in WRF. Experimental, namelist-toggled (bl_mynn_cz0hr),
  upstream diagnostic regularization intended to mitigate spurious quenching,
  numerical stiffness, and runaway nocturnal surface cold-pool biases in
  stable boundary layer simulations.
keywords:
  - WRF
  - MYNN-EDMF
  - planetary boundary layer
  - stable boundary layer
  - Richardson number
  - turbulence closure
license: MIT
